<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 161 0 R
/E (Rank r only ever tests 3 + 2r + 2pk. For any odd prime d dividing p, that term vanishes mod d, so rank r is locked to one residue class. The rank at 0 mod d gets only multiples of d, rejected on the first iteration.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
